## Principles

Prefer generation, verification, evidence, simplification, interfaces over vendors, single sources of truth, small validated changes.
Reject duplicate authorities, speculative abstractions, silent behaviour changes, feature accumulation, architecture drift.

## Success

Measured by constitutional compliance, verification, debt reduction, product integrity — not feature count or novelty.
Product Proof interactive review drives priorities alongside the constitutional backlog.
